# ── Git boundary (DD-001) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Nested project repos are NEVER tracked by the kingdom repo. Project code
# syncs to each project's own remote. Per-project kingdom-synced state lives
# at .orchestrator/projects/state/{project}/ (tracked here) and is symlinked
# into each project as projects/{project}/.orchestrator and .claude.
/projects/

# ── Machine-local runtime state — never synced ──────────────────────────
/.orchestrator/runtime/

# ── Secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# ── Machine-local Claude Code settings ──────────────────────────────────
.claude/settings.local.json

# ── OS / editor noise ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
